<title>USA: US high-yld fund inflows $458.1 mln in latest week.</title>
<headline>US high-yld fund inflows $458.1 mln in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net cash inflows to U.S. high-yield mutual funds totaled $458.1 million in the week ended June 18, AMG Data Services reported.</p>
<p>The number compares with inflows of $627.4 million in the week ended June 11 and inflows of $373.9 million one week earlier, AMG said. It brings total inflows for the month of June to nearly $1.5 billion.</p>
</text>
